  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00487",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "在我听来，先生的回答简直平庸得无聊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "To my ears, Sensei's answer was so ordinary that it was almost boring.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00487",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "既然先生失去了兴致，我也觉得很扫兴，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Since Sensei had lost interest, I felt quite let down as well,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00487",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我板起脸快步走起来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I put on a stern face and began walking quickly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00487",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "于是，先生有点跟不上了，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As a result, Sensei fell a little behind,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00487",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "在后面“喂、喂”地叫着。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "calling after me from behind, \"Hey, hey.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00488",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“瞧瞧看。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"See?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00489",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“怎么了？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"What do you mean?\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00490",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“你的情绪呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Your mood.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00490",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我这么一句话，你就立刻不高兴了。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "One word from me, and you immediately become displeased.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00491",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我为了等先生，停下脚步转过身来时，先生看着我的脸说道。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I stopped and turned around to wait for Sensei, he looked at my face and said this.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00492",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "1.羽织：和服短外套。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "1. Haori: a short outer jacket worn with kimono.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
